1
00:00:00,086 --> 00:00:03,526
(Shopkeeper:)- You?
- Didn't see that one coming, did you?

2
00:00:04,156 --> 00:00:06,746
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah?
Well, you're not gonna see this coming.

3
00:00:07,393 --> 00:00:10,623
- Aah!
- Oh, my God! Oh, my God, are you okay?

4
00:00:11,997 --> 00:00:14,487
(Penny:)- What the hell do you have in there?
- My wallet, keys...

5
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:17,897
(Amy:)...and a coffee can full of change
I've been meaning to take to the bank.

6
00:00:18,938 --> 00:00:21,428
- Don't move. I'll get some ice.
- Are you okay?

7
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:25,770
(Penny:)Get away from me, or I swear to God,
I will rip out what's left of your pubes.

8
00:00:25,978 --> 00:00:28,138
(Leonard:)- Here.
- Oh, thanks. Aah.

9
00:00:28,347 --> 00:00:30,547
(Bernadette:)Amy, you think maybe
this has gotten out of hand?

10
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:32,620
(Penny:)Gee, you think?

11
00:00:33,619 --> 00:00:36,779
(Amy:)I do. Penny, Bernadette and I are sorry.

12
00:00:36,989 --> 00:00:39,619
- You hit her. What did I do?
- You had my car towed.

13
00:00:39,825 --> 00:00:42,765
- You were parked in Howard's spot.
- I was in Sheldon's spot.

14
00:00:42,962 --> 00:00:44,332
(Bernadette:)Sheldon doesn't have a spot.

15
00:00:44,563 --> 00:00:46,963
(Penny:)Guys, I think I need to go
to the emergency room.

16
00:00:47,166 --> 00:00:49,156
- Okay, let's go.
- I'll drive. You can see...

17
00:00:49,368 --> 00:00:53,358
(Amy:)...where the tow truck scratched my car.
- The tow truck didn't scratch your car.

18
00:00:53,606 --> 00:01:06,026
- How do you know?
- Because I did it.

